<div class="hero"><div class="heroCard"><div class="eyebrow">$RUGCX • SOCIAL WAR ROOM</div><h1>THE CIRCUS IS <span>OPEN.</span></h1><p>One command center for meme-token discovery, social raids, Solana campaigns and optional premium promotion tools. Each user can launch up to 3 free raids every 24 hours.</p><div class="actions"><button class="primary" data-page-link="explore">Explore Tokens</button><button class="secondary" data-page-link="create">Start a Raid</button></div><div class="socialLinks"><a class="socialLink" href="https://t.me/rugcxx" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="icon">✈️</span> Telegram</a><a class="socialLink" href="https://x.com/RugCircusX" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="icon">𝕏</span> X</a><a class="socialLink" href="https://pump.fun/coin/3wLrSM5gkSSSQGoivnnN32Xh6ffjDwFeJFMqnNnSpump" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="icon">🪙</span> $RUGCX</a></div></div><div class="metrics"><div class="metric"><b>FREE</b><span>Raids</span></div><div class="metric"><b>0.02</b><span>Starting Raid GRAM</span></div><div class="metric"><b>0.15</b><span>Premium / 30 Days</span></div><div class="metric"><b>$RUGCX</b><span>Pump.fun</span></div></div></div>
<div class="grid"><div class="panel"><div class="panelHead"><div><div class="eyebrow">⚔️ FEATURED RAID</div><h2 style="font-size:22px;margin-top:7px">Main Raid</h2></div><span class="tag" id="featuredRaidTag">LIVE</span></div><div id="featuredRaid"><div class="status">Loading active raid…</div></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="panelHead"><div><div class="eyebrow">🔥 LIVE CAMPAIGNS</div><h2 style="font-size:22px;margin-top:7px">Active Raids</h2></div><span class="tag">LIVE</span></div><div class="tokens" id="campaignList"><div class="status">Loading live campaigns…</div></div></div></div>
<div class="sponsor"><div><b>🎪 SPONSORED OFFER</b><span>Support the command center through the sponsor network.</span><div class="sponsorReward">🏆 <strong>+2 leaderboard points</strong> for each valid sponsored offer visit · up to 3 rewards per 24 hours.</div></div><a id="sponsorLink" href="/api/sponsor/click" target="_blank" rel="noopener">VISIT OFFER ↗</a></div>
<div class="grid"><div class="panel"><div class="panelHead"><h2>🪙 $RUGCX</h2><span class="tag">PUMP.FUN</span></div><p class="muted" style="line-height:1.6">Official RUGCIRCUS token page.</p><a class="primary" style="display:inline-block;text-decoration:none" href="https://pump.fun/coin/3wLrSM5gkSSSQGoivnnN32Xh6ffjDwFeJFMqnNnSpump" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open $RUGCX ↗</a></div><div class="panel"><div class="panelHead"><h2>🎪 Raid Access</h2><span class="tag">FREE RAIDS</span></div><p class="muted" style="line-height:1.6">Each user can launch up to 3 free raids every 24 hours. Paid packages are optional for extra promotion and longer featured placement.</p><button class="primary" data-page-link="create">Launch Free Raid</button></div></div></section>
<section class="page" id="page-explore"><div class="panel"><div class="panelHead"><div><div class="eyebrow">TOKEN DIRECTORY</div><h2 style="font-size:26px;margin-top:7px">Explore the Circus</h2></div><span class="tag">TON</span></div><div class="tokens" id="tokenList"></div></div></section>
<section class="page" id="page-movers"><div class="grid"><div class="panel"><div class="panelHead"><div><div class="eyebrow">MARKET WATCH</div><h2 style="font-size:26px;margin-top:7px">Pump.fun Movers</h2></div><span class="tag">LIVE</span></div><p class="muted" style="line-height:1.6">Track the coins currently moving on Pump.fun. Movers can change quickly, so this page links directly to the live Pump.fun market view.</p><a class="primary" style="display:inline-block;text-decoration:none" href="https://pump.fun/explore" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Live Movers ↗</a></div><div class="panel"><div class="panelHead"><h2>🔎 Market Tools</h2><span class="tag">TON</span></div><div class="socialLinks"><a class="socialLink" href="https://pump.fun/explore" target="_blank" rel="noopener">🟢 Pump.fun Movers</a><a class="socialLink" href="https://dexscreener.com/solana" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📈 DexScreener</a><a class="socialLink" href="https://birdeye.so/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">🦅 Birdeye</a><a class="socialLink" href="https://jup.ag/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">🪐 Jupiter</a><a class="socialLink" href="https://raydium.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">⚡ Raydium</a></div></div></div><div class="panel" style="margin-top:18px"><div class="panelHead"><h2>🔥 Pump.fun Callouts</h2><span class="tag">RAID LINKS</span></div><p class="muted" style="line-height:1.6">Campaigns can include a direct Pump.fun Callout link so raiders can jump straight into the callout page.</p></div></section><section class="page" id="page-create"><div class="grid"><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">CAMPAIGN BUILDER</div><h2 style="font-size:26px;margin:8px 0 20px">Launch a Raid</h2><div class="form"><label>Contract Address<input id="ca" placeholder="Paste Solana token mint address"></label><label>Token Ticker<input id="ticker" placeholder="RUGCX"></label><label>Token Name<input id="tokenName" placeholder="RUGCIRCUS"></label><label>X Post URL<input id="xUrl" placeholder="https://x.com/.../status/..."></label><label>Raid Image URL <span class="muted">(optional — X image is used automatically if left empty)</span><input id="imageUrl" placeholder="https://.../image.jpg"></label><label>TikTok URL<input id="ttUrl" placeholder="https://www.tiktok.com/@.../video/..."></label><label>Telegram<input id="tgUrl" placeholder="https://t.me/..."></label><input type="hidden" id="tgGroup" value="@rugcxx"><label>Pump.fun Callout URL<input id="calloutUrl" placeholder="https://pump.fun/callouts/..."></label><label>Raid Copy<textarea id="raidCopy" placeholder="Your raid message..."></textarea></label><div class="status" id="premiumStatus">Free raids are sent automatically to the official @rugcxx Telegram group. No wallet is required.</div></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">LOW-FRICTION PRICING</div><h2 style="font-size:26px;margin:8px 0 20px">Choose Your Raid</h2><div class="plans"><div class="plan featured"><b>FREE RAID</b><strong>0 GRAM</strong><p>Basic raids are currently free.</p><button type="button" class="primary" id="launchFreeRaid">Launch Free Raid</button></div><div class="plan"><b>FEATURED</b><strong>0.75 GRAM</strong><p>Featured placement for 24h.</p><button type="button" class="secondary" id="launchFeatured">Select</button></div><div class="plan"><b>MEGA RAID</b><strong>2 GRAM</strong><p>X + TikTok + Telegram for 48h.</p><button type="button" class="primary" id="launchMega">Select</button></div><div class="plan"><b>FRONT ROW</b><strong>4 GRAM</strong><p>Premium placement and 7-day campaign.</p><button type="button" class="secondary" id="launchFrontRow">Select</button></div></div><p class="muted" style="font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:18px">Free raids need no wallet. A wallet is requested only when you choose a paid GRAM package.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="page" id="page-premium"><div class="grid"><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">PREMIUM OPERATOR</div><h2 style="font-size:26px;margin:8px 0 12px">Use the Bot. Keep Your Payout Wallet.</h2><p class="muted" style="line-height:1.6">Telegram group administration remains free. Premium is for operators who want to run paid token campaigns using their own TON payout wallet.</p><div class="plan featured"><b>30 DAYS</b><strong>6 GRAM</strong><p>30 days · Use your own payout wallet for campaign earnings.</p><button class="primary" id="openPremiumButton">Activate Premium</button></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</div><div class="social"><article class="post"><b>1 · Connect wallet</b><p>Connect the TON wallet that should receive campaign payments.</p></article><article class="post"><b>2 · Pay 6 GRAM</b><p>The activation payment goes to the RUGCIRCUS platform treasury.</p></article><article class="post"><b>3 · Run campaigns</b><p>Paid campaign payments can then be verified against your Premium payout wallet.</p></article></div><div class="status" id="premiumResult">Premium status: not checked</div></div></div></section>
